Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for RootHide jailbreaks.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package uses the RootHide layout with jbroot isolation
 and supports iOS 15 or newer on A12+ devices.
 .
 Beta 5 adds a resolution and frame rate picker, Prioritize Quality and
 Performance, and French, Spanish, Chinese and Japanese.
